      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to untreated W–Cu, the Ti-modified composite will have a more uniform microstructure with fewer voids and less phase separation.",
